  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are aware of and may find humor in racially charged stereotypes, particularly those who recognize or perpetuate the 'lazy/unemployed characterizations' anti-Black stereotype. The meme is designed to elicit a reaction from people who understand the condescending tone of 'good morning sleepyhead' and the visual association with an elderly Black man, often used to mock or demean Black people by implying inherent laziness or unproductivity. This audience may include those who engage with internet memes that rely on harmful racial tropes, and who may not recognize the hateful intent or its impact on Black communities.",
